  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b8c5f8bea1b438d4687ad9b712e77c3e, type: 3}
  m_Name: Level 1-4 After Battle Cutscene
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::CutsceneData
  line:
  - speakerName: Jose Rizal
    speakerType: 0
    hero: {fileID: 0}
    enemy: {fileID: 0}
    Dialogue: "I left Bi\xF1an on December 17, 1870. I was nine back then, first
      time seeing what a steamer really was. It seemed to me most beautiful and in
      every way admirable. I was the only passenger from Bi\xF1an. Two sailors put
      my baggage into the cabin. "
    isLeftSide: 0
    pose: 0
  - speakerName: Jose Rizal
    speakerType: 0
    hero: {fileID: 0}
    enemy: {fileID: 0}
    Dialogue: Then I went to check my belongings. I thought I was going to be alone
      in the cabin, but a Frenchman, Arturo Camps, who was a friend of my father,
      looked after me. The journey seemed very long but we finally arrived at Kalamba.
    isLeftSide: 0
    pose: 0
  - speakerName: Jose Rizal
    speakerType: 0
    hero: {fileID: 0}
    enemy: {fileID: 0}
    Dialogue: Oh! How happy I was to see the shore! At once I wanted to jump into
      the first banca. A deckhand took me in his arms and put me into the captain's
      boat. Then the Frenchman came and four sailors rowed us ashore. It's impossible
      to describe how happy I was when I saw a servant waiting for us in the carriage.
    isLeftSide: 0
    pose: 0
  - speakerName: Jose Rizal
    speakerType: 0
    hero: {fileID: 0}
    enemy: {fileID: 0}
    Dialogue: I jumped in and soon found myself again in our home, happy in love
      of my family. Here end my recollections of that period of mingled sadness and
      gladness., in which for the first time, I came to know anybody of foreign birth.
    isLeftSide: 0
    pose: 0
  - speakerName: Jose Rizal
    speakerType: 0
    hero: {fileID: 0}
    enemy: {fileID: 0}
    Dialogue: Finally, I'm home.
    isLeftSide: 0
    pose: 0
  - speakerName: Narrator
    speakerType: 2
    hero: {fileID: 0}
    enemy: {fileID: 0}
    Dialogue: Chapter II Complete.
    isLeftSide: 0
    pose: 0
  - speakerName: 
    speakerType: 2
    hero: {fileID: 0}
    enemy: {fileID: 0}
    Dialogue: Chapter III The Injustice Done My Mother
    isLeftSide: 0
    pose: 0
